            "review_title": "Review at RetroSaigon Cafe- Craft Beer, Cocktail Bar",
            "review_text": "Passenger32973292497\n1 contribution\n0\nSo chill\nAug 2026 • Friends\nOne of the chillest place I've been to in saigon. It's different to so many other bars I've been to and the service is exceptional. Try it out, you'll end up coming back like I have. Loved the environment.\nInsider tip:\nThere are lots of drinks to chose from. Make sure you take your time to pick out the ones that fits your mood and taste.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 23, 2026",
